==============================================================================
PERSISTENCE TEST -- does trader performance predict itself?
==============================================================================
  split           each trader's own history midpoint
  min trades      20 closing fills per window
  MM-like         excluded (>60% passive)

  traders usable: 1630
    dropped, mm_like          338
    dropped, span<30d         333
    dropped, too_few_trades   247

  SURVIVORSHIP NOTE: traders with too few trades in window B are dropped,
  which includes anyone who blew up or quit mid-history. This sample is
  conditioned on still being active, so it is biased TOWARD persistence.

